# Cloudflare Pages headers for this independent design-concept demo.
#
# X-Robots-Tag backs the in-page noindex,nofollow + robots.txt disallow so
# non-HTML responses are also marked non-indexable. This requests
# non-indexing; it does not make a publicly accessible preview URL private.
# Remove or flip only on owner-approved publication (with
# siteConfig.deployment.allowIndexing = true).
#
# The remaining headers are a conservative baseline that does not change site
# behavior: no CSP is set here because Astro inlines per-page scripts/styles
# and a strict policy would break them without a nonce plan.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
